  <History Date="05-07-10" Author="Jonathan Moreton" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="05-01-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Adapted from Platinum Spot 5R" />
  <History Date="03-05-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised func names.  Fixed raw ranges.  Added raw to Gobo2Func." />
  <History Date="03-05-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Adjusted wheel resolutions.  Fixed power on and locate." />
  <History Date="03-05-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Adapted from Platinum Spot 15RPro" />
  <History Date="20-07-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Edited updated colour names" />
  <History Date="10-10-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Changed colour speed range to locate at 0." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="25-05-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added gobo swatches.  Added channel counts to mode names." />
  <History Date="25-05-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased macro delay in attempt to fix customer bug report (no details in manufacturer's documentation)" />
